<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On June 11, 2025, we held a general
meeting of shareholders, or June 2025 GM, and our shareholders passed resolutions to (i) subdivide our Ordinary Shares of &#163;0.00005
nominal value each into one ordinary share of &#163;0.000001 nominal value and 49 D Deferred Shares of &#163;0.000001 nominal value
