<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The following table sets forth our
capitalization as of June 30, 2025. <span style="background-color: white">The information in this table is unaudited and should be read
in conjunction with our consolidated unaudited interim financial statements and notes thereto and other financial information incorporated
by reference into this prospectus</span>.</p>

